aggressive tax avoidance of people  really in the top one percent so we need  to restore the progressivity of the tax  system that may not be wildly popular or  politically feasible in the short term  but we've got to keep beating that drum  eventually there will be a realignment  either that or we can become a kind of  society we really don't want to be I'll  tell everybody once again we've been  speaking with Chuck Collins he's an  author he's a senior scholar at the  Institute for Policy Studies in  Washington DC and the co-founder of  wealth for common good Chuck thank you  so much for being on with us today thank  you David good chat chatting with you

